    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="jablonski_network builds the 3-state (S1, T1, S0) Jablonski excited-state decay network as a StoichiometricNetwork -- reusing the kinetics domain&#x27;s general mass-action reaction-network engine rather than reimplementing rate-equation integration. The numerical integration is checked here against jablonski_populations_analytic&#x27;s closed-form solution.">

